Return to Never Land (also known as Peter Pan in Return to Never Land) is a 2002 American
animated adventure fantasy film produced by Walt Disney Television Animation.

12
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:06,000
A sequel to Walt Disney Feature Animation's 1953 film Peter Pan, the
film is based on the 1908 play When Wendy Grew Up by J.M.

13
